":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7767","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7767/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7767/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7767/events","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7767","id":6273585591,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNr8fsQ","number":7767,"title":"fix(nixos): KRDP KWallet user store + Plasma-session start (Hyprland start deferred)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-11-08T17:27:12Z","updated_at":"2026-11-11T18:40:39Z","closed_at":"2026-11-11T18:39:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7767","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7767","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7767.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7767.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-11T18:39:47Z"},"body":"## Summary\n- Add KWallet to the Home Manager user profile so its D-Bus activation service is available in the session.\n- Start the existing KRDP user service from `hyprland-session.target` as well as Plasma, and order it after the generic desktop portal.\n\nRefs #5415\n\n## Validation\n- `nix-instantiate --parse nixos/hosts/amd-krdp.nix` — passed.\n- Nix evaluation of the KRDP unit's install targets — passed (Plasma and Hyprland).\n- Nix evaluation of the relevant Home Manager packages — passed (`krdp-6.8.2`, `kwallet-6.31.0`).\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\n- Full host derivation-path evaluation exceeded 120 seconds and was stopped; no build was attempted.\n\n## Follow-up\nNot deployed yet. The NixOS deploy and end-to-end NLA logon verification remain required; keep #5415 open until that evidence is recorded. No credential value is included here.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796750836&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7767&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7767&signature=7821c627a68ea02ae589d04dce9876bac6e50709075818851b6ec29bb47b266c\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7767?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * KRDP now starts in both Plasma and Hyprland sessions.\n  * KWallet is included in the user’s installed packages.\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * KRDP startup now waits for the desktop portal service.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7767/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7767/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/3481","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/3481/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/3481/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/3481/events","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/3481","id":6145698681,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABMF0QvA","number":3481,"title":"fix(bin): plain-object body guard in seven chat proxies (#2816)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-11-01T10:09:44Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T10:32:31Z","closed_at":"2026-11-01T10:32:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/3481","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/3481","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/3481.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/3481.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-01T10:32:28Z"},"body":"Fixes #2816 (triage task 3941 CONFIRMED at main 472b752b; fix task 5415).\n\nThe seven unguarded bin chat proxies (design-code, codex, claude-code, agy, antigravity-ls, commandcode, muse) dereferenced the JSON-parsed chat-completions body unguarded: a `null` body (or array/string/number) threw a TypeError at the first deref and the process exited 1. This adds an inline plain-object guard immediately after each chat-completions `JSON.parse`, returning that proxy's existing 400 shape — mirroring the already-guarded clef-proxy (\"expected an object\") and opencode-route-proxy (\"must be a JSON object\").\n\nAudit (per acceptance): each of the seven files has exactly one request-body JSON POST route (chat completions). muse's `/v1/responses` route already guards via `aliasResponsesRequestBody`; the remaining `JSON.parse` sites in these files parse upstream responses or local files, not request bodies.\n\nTests (laptop, node --test):\n- New per-proxy regression test in each `bin/*.test.mjs`: bodies `null`, `[1,2]`, `\"x\"`, `42` → 400, then a further request is still served — 7/7 pass.\n- Full suites: design-code 11/11, claude-code 6/6, agy 12/12, antigravity-ls 13/13, commandcode 3/3, muse 25/25; codex full suite result appended in a comment when its long run finishes (its new regression test passes).\n\nNo behaviour change for object bodies or malformed JSON (existing parse-catch 400s untouched).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/3481?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796119788&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=3481&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F3481&signature=8cefd6907f0d185f73bc669cdf4ab8e5445f465198339d1315e023a93458745d\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/3481/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/3481/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}